close_reason: A stream with a non-record line and a chain break recovers with salvage followed by the advised repair
contract_change:
  api: pm history-repair <id> --salvage-tail result and behavior
  before: "Salvage refused any stream whose chain did not verify, even when it only removed lines that cannot hold a record, and reported verify_ok true, verify_errors [] and chain_drift_before false unconditionally"
  after: "Removing only non-record lines no longer requires a verified chain; the result reports the real chain verdict and a history_chain_unverified warning names the repair previews. A scalar-only stream salvages to an empty stream with no salvage record, and for a live item a history_stream_empty warning names the rebuild. Discarding an invalid suffix still requires a verified prefix"
  migrate: "Read history.verify_ok and the warnings after a salvage instead of assuming a verified chain, and run the named repair when the chain is unverified"
escape_class: production_defect
gate_evidence:
  disposition: gate_added
  owner: pm-rpucvb
  gate_id: history-salvage-double-fault
  negative_control: "tests/integration/lifecycle/history-remedies.integration.spec.ts appends a JSON null to a stream with a bridgeable chain break, salvages it, and requires verify_ok false with the real verify_errors, a byte-prefix-preserving result, the bridgeable chain_mismatch remedy, and a clean history_drift check and history --verify --strict-exit after pm history-repair <id> --append-only. It also asserts that discarding an invalid suffix after a broken chain still refuses, that nothing to discard names the repair, that a scalar-only stream salvages to an empty stream which pm history-repair <id> rebuilds, that a stream naming another item refuses, and that a deleted item keeps its last assignee for strict ownership. tests/unit/core/history/history-replay.spec.ts fixes the lenient replay of root transitions and deletions."
  local_checks[1]: node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- tests/integration/lifecycle/history-remedies.integration.spec.ts tests/integration/history-durability.integration.spec.ts tests/unit/core/history/history-replay.spec.ts
  hosted_checks[2]: CI / Gates (static),CI / Gates (coverage)
